  "question": {
    "text": "Let the vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo></math>&nbsp;be coplanar. If the vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are also coplanar, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;"
  },
